    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aNew Manor Era\u300b\u2014 Your Immersive Journey of European Manor Management</strong> In this picturesque classical European manor, you will step into the role of an estate lord: cultivate crops, raise livestock, craft gourmet delicacies, establish trade routes, revitalize maritime commerce, and collaborate with like-minded partners to build a thriving legacy in the <strong>New Manor Era</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aNew Manor Era\u300b\u2014 Your Immersive Journey of European Manor Management</strong> In this picturesque classical European manor, you will step into the role of an estate lord: cultivate crops, raise livestock, craft gourmet delicacies, establish trade routes, revitalize maritime commerce, and collaborate with like-minded partners to build a thriving legacy in the <strong>New Manor Era</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Vegetable gardens, orchards, and pastures; wine cellars, kitchens, and pastry rooms. Hunt in the forest, engage in trade and navigation, recruit talents, and uncover the secrets of the true and false queens. Come on! This is such a classic European-style pastoral game!",
